Item SellItem  Qty;pos;total;shp
⍝ Processes a product sale by updating stock quantity and total sold amount.
    pos←ItemName⍳⊂Item
    shp←⍴ItemName
    :If pos>shp
        ⎕←'Item not found.'
    :ElseIf Quantity[pos]=0
        ⎕←'Item is out of stock.'
    :ElseIf Quantity[pos]<Qty
        ⎕←'Not enough stock.'
    :Else
        Quantity[pos]←Quantity[pos]-Qty
        Sold[pos]←Sold[pos]+Qty
        total←Qty×Price[pos]
        Revenue←Revenue+total
        ⎕←'==========================='
        ⎕←'ESPRESSO HOUSE'
        ⎕←'==========================='
        ⎕←''
        ⎕←'Item Sold:'
        ⎕←Item
        ⎕←''
        ⎕←'Quantity:'
        ⎕←Qty
        ⎕←''
        ⎕←'Price per item:'
        ⎕←Price[pos]
        ⎕←''
        ⎕←'Total price:'
        ⎕←total
        ⎕←''
        ⎕←'Remaining stock:'
        ⎕←Quantity[pos]
        ⎕←''
        ⎕←'Total Revenue:'
        ⎕← Revenue
        ⎕←'==========================='
    :EndIf
